     3,
     "<div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi dear</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I am going to do differential item functioning (DIF) with\r\ngraded response model (polyatomous : with 4 category) .in uniform DIF ( test\r\nfor intercept) , <span>df in Wald statistic is 1. Why?\r\nWhere is my mistake?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span>set.seed(12345)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span>a1 &lt;- a2 &lt;- matrix(abs(runif(15, min = 1, max = 2)), ncol=1)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span>diffs &lt;- t(apply(matrix(runif(15*3, .3, 1), 15), 1, cumsum))</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span>diffs &lt;- -(diffs - rowMeans(diffs))</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span>d1 &lt;- d2<span>  </span>&lt;- diffs + rnorm(15)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span>a2[1:2, ] &lt;- a1[1:2, ]/3</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span>d1[c(1,3), ] &lt;- d2[c(1,3), ]/4</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span>head(data.frame(a.group1 = a1, a.group2 = a2, d.group1 = d1, d.group2 =\r\nd2))</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>itemtype &lt;-\r\nrep(&#39;graded&#39;, nrow(a1))</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>N1 &lt;- 500</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>N2 &lt;- 250</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>dataset1 &lt;-\r\nsimdata(a1, d1, N1, itemtype=&#39;graded&#39;)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>dataset2 &lt;-\r\nsimdata(a2, d2, N2, itemtype,mu = .1, sigma = matrix(1.5))</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>dat &lt;- rbind(dataset1,\r\ndataset2)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>group &lt;- c(rep(&#39;D1&#39;,\r\nN1), rep(&#39;D2&#39;, N2))</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>model &lt;-\r\nmultipleGroup(dat, 1, group, SE = TRUE)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>resulta1dWald &lt;-\r\nDIF(model, c(&#39;d1&#39;), Wald = TRUE, p.adjust = &#39;fdr&#39;)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>resulta1dWald</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/mirt-package/attach/3a11b3110884c/Auto%20Generated%20Inline%20Image%201?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">please help me. thanks<br><span></span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div>"
